{"summary":"The miserable journey of a broken man...","description":"LISA: The Painful is the miserable, hilarious RPG of your wildest nightmares. Undertake a relentless journey through the post-apocalyptic wasteland of Olathe. Beneath its charming exterior is a world full of disgust and moral desolation, where you will learn what kind of person you are by being FORCED to make choices that permanently affect the gameplay. Make sacrifices to keep your party members alive, whether it's taking a beating for them, losing limbs, or some other inhuman torture. In this world, you will learn that being selfish and heartless is the only way to survive...","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood, Sexual Themes, Strong Language, Use of Drugs and Alcohol","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence, Drugs, Discriminatory Language, Strong Language","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0kmzoW5aULQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Kzot2OVarE34Xh_4cvkPgF56H5ezyUZAUMvwcOSmGMJKqICgprOqgB79c1WN-9Svyu3KW1c5irAVjwlEbIONQQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LrXM03-2YEDddPgf8bWMGI8J72FVsf2U1Fd75A4T2wWLJ_HskmtH1xGpLwt30DVdMdihi4Pyq3s4aHm252unaQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BIIfRp4GF6CZXisNzMnTzqlKRhHQxtJZluoWddsYsjUY8dlaLUBjyV3RzzgK9vvlP5B80cPgTVIdyutlqVbrFQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TB1pIdheXsknNlN2PuBJ14_9dEEISQqbDQJhomaUqhD2GuzD0GTnlKPeq5dckKRxKiNmCndDZ9nkH6hAJsUX","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9iqnfRRQCM-oiWY_RiUjKmGU9d94mgTzWhkpuYfZlTNSxuLTmZZrprDku_MSvUrfwO-PS38CFjEgrsx_3fg4Uw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JUM1-FxXC2W3n2JrsXn3n2KB7_9j6j38Uj2OGFG5oOzFvnBNnhCKekfc8mnxujj-ZOMIozt9mR07vXGaBnxUog","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7uayzb3AwscyCxcN3wgiVUZJUv67wNEP8w9bOEhUYYJr0oNX57gmOxq4Rzz2Xipufs3Y7s8AT0yCMK2MjdD4CaU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XVvbkX82Kef-DzncJOP7ay6agdPu9R3owhalptyltf4XX57NHz_YvotNv2M4RFejSbJ3jeaqn0u5WrSOk4rSOOU","https://play-lh.googleuserconte